# Allow-list: the image build needs the solution props, the production projects, the Hub
# sources, three docker/ files and the libddb pin script (scripts/ddb-release.sh). Everything else (local data such as
# Registry.Web/registry-data, test projects and their downloaded data, build outputs,
# node_modules) stays out of the build context.
*

!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!Registry.Web
!Registry.Adapters
!Registry.Common
!Registry.Ports
!Registry.Web.Data
!Registry.Web.Data.MySqlMigrations
!Registry.Web.Data.SqliteMigrations
!Registry.Web.Identity
!Registry.Web.Identity.MySqlMigrations
!Registry.Web.Identity.SqliteMigrations
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/healthcheck.sh
!docker/FolderProfile.xml
!scripts/ddb-release.sh

# Excluded again inside the allowed folders
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/TestResults
**/*.md
**/*.lscache
Registry.Web/registry-data
Registry.Web/data
Registry.Web/uploads
Registry.Web/logs
Registry.Web/temp
Registry.Web/ddbstore
Registry.Web/App_Data
Registry.Web/*.csv
Registry.Web/ClientApp/build
Registry.Web/ClientApp/coverage
Registry.Web/ClientApp/stats.json
Registry.Web/ClientApp/.git
